{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01764","headline":"杂曲歌辞 长相思三首 二 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 长相思三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日色已尽花含烟，月明欲素愁不眠。\n赵瑟初停凤凰柱，蜀琴欲奏鸳鸯弦。\n此曲有意无人传，愿随春风寄燕然，忆君迢迢隔青天。\n昔日横波目，今成流泪泉。\n不信妾肠断，归来看取明镜前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}